# Project Structure Guidelines

## Root Structure

```
src/app/
├── core/           # Singleton services, guards, interceptors
├── shared/         # Reusable components, pipes, directives
├── layouts/        # Page layouts (auth, dashboard)
├── features/       # Feature modules (lazy loaded)
├── models/         # TypeScript interfaces
└── environments/   # Environment configs
```

## Core Module

Singleton services that should be imported once in app config.

```
core/
├── auth/
│   ├── guards/
│   │   ├── auth.guard.ts      # Protect authenticated routes
│   │   ├── guest.guard.ts     # Protect public routes
│   │   ├── role.guard.ts      # Role-based access
│   │   └── index.ts
│   ├── interceptors/
│   │   ├── jwt.interceptor.ts # Add auth header
│   │   ├── error.interceptor.ts
│   │   └── index.ts
│   ├── services/
│   │   ├── auth.service.ts
│   │   ├── token.service.ts
│   │   └── index.ts
│   └── index.ts
├── services/
│   ├── config.service.ts
│   ├── notification.service.ts
│   ├── storage.service.ts
│   └── index.ts
├── providers/
│   └── core.providers.ts
└── index.ts
```

## Shared Module

Reusable components with no business logic.

```
shared/
├── components/
│   └── ui/
│       ├── button/
│       │   ├── button.component.ts
│       │   └── index.ts
│       ├── input/
│       ├── card/
│       ├── modal/
│       ├── toast/
│       ├── select/
│       ├── loading-spinner/
│       └── index.ts
├── directives/
│   ├── click-outside.directive.ts
│   ├── has-role.directive.ts
│   ├── auto-focus.directive.ts
│   └── index.ts
├── pipes/
│   ├── truncate.pipe.ts
│   ├── safe-html.pipe.ts
│   └── index.ts
├── validators/
│   ├── custom-validators.ts
│   └── index.ts
└── index.ts
```

## Feature Module

Domain-specific functionality, lazy loaded.

```
features/cylinders/
├── components/          # Presentational components
│   ├── oxygen-tank-card/
│   │   ├── oxygen-tank-card.component.ts
│   │   └── oxygen-tank-card.component.html
│   ├── tank-status-badge/
│   └── tank-filters/
├── pages/               # Smart components (containers)
│   └── cylinders-list/
│       ├── cylinders-list.component.ts
│       └── cylinders-list.component.html
├── services/            # Domain services
│   └── oxygen-tank.service.ts
├── cylinders.routes.ts  # Route definitions
└── AGENTS.md            # Domain documentation
```

## Models

TypeScript interfaces, organized by domain.

```
models/
├── auth.model.ts        # User, LoginRequest, etc.
├── oxygen-tank.model.ts # OxygenTank, TankStatus, etc.
├── customer.model.ts    # Customer, Contract, etc.
├── api-response.model.ts
└── index.ts
```

## Naming Conventions

| Type | Pattern | Example |
|------|---------|---------|
| Component | `kebab-case.component.ts` | `tank-card.component.ts` |
| Service | `kebab-case.service.ts` | `oxygen-tank.service.ts` |
| Guard | `kebab-case.guard.ts` | `auth.guard.ts` |
| Pipe | `kebab-case.pipe.ts` | `truncate.pipe.ts` |
| Directive | `kebab-case.directive.ts` | `click-outside.directive.ts` |
| Model | `kebab-case.model.ts` | `oxygen-tank.model.ts` |
| Routes | `feature.routes.ts` | `cylinders.routes.ts` |

## Barrel Files (index.ts)

Every directory should have an index.ts that exports public API:

```typescript
// shared/components/ui/index.ts
export { ButtonComponent } from './button/button.component';
export { InputComponent } from './input/input.component';
export { CardComponent } from './card/card.component';
```

## Import Paths

Always use path aliases:

```typescript
// Good
import { AuthService } from '@core/auth';
import { ButtonComponent } from '@shared/components/ui';
import { OxygenTank } from '@models/oxygen-tank.model';

// Bad
import { AuthService } from '../../../core/auth';
```
